The City Infrastructure~
   You have entered a large room filled with elaborate arches and 
pillars, all supporting the centre of the city. If these massive
constructs were to fail then the city would collapse in upon itself. 
The structures become more concentrated in number to the east, past a 
stone gate. You suddenly realize you are running out of air down here, 
and had better move fast!
