#21201
Center of the Lost City~
   This is the center of, perhaps, the strangest town you have ever visited.
First there are no 'normal' citizens. They have all been turned into living
statues, apparently so they can live for all eternity. And the city itself
represents the perfect balance these people are striving for. Everything is in
reflected by its opposite. And to top it all off, A huge castle is suspended
directly above you, supported by stone bridges connected to the city wall.
A large tower looms to the north, casting a long shadow over the city.
~
