#21298
The Cracked Anvil~
   The name of this fine shop obviously refers solely to the anvil and not to 
the fine armor that it produces. Having hundreds of years to work on his 
products the armorer has obviously reached the top of his profession. Every 
piece of armor in this shop rivals that which you have ever seen, gleaming in 
